# Hands: a block in hand. Taking a block from the toolbar puts it in the hand as a ghost; the right trigger places it where
# the hand points, the left trigger removes the block pointed at (creative tools), a tap of X switches symmetry and a click of
# the right stick switches between large and small blocks; the empty hand puts the block away.
# World: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). A large armor block is built 3 m ahead as a grid to build on.

plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- What the world needs: creative tools, a large armor block in toolbar slot 1, and one on a grid ahead to build on ----------

admin creativeTools
toolbar 1 CubeBlock/LargeBlockArmorBlock
# out of the starter base, where nothing is built within 10 m, to build there
goto open
# Before anything is built: no large armor block within 8 m of the astronaut (Earth Planet's starter base has none there).
read nearby LargeBlockArmorBlock 8
expect result == []
build LargeBlockArmorBlock 3 as Test base
# 5.5 m from its middle: the block placed on its near face (4.25 m ahead) is clear of the astronaut
goto Test base 5.5
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.2 -0.3
hand right 0.2 1.3 -0.3
wait 1
read nearby LargeBlockArmorBlock 8
expect 0.subtype == LargeBlockArmorBlock

# ---- Slot 1 of the tools wheel: the block comes into the hand ----------------------------------------------------------------------

press left grip
wait 1
stick left 0 1
wait 0.5
release left grip
wait 0.3
stick left 0 0
wait 2
expect log Build mode on: LargeBlockArmorBlock within 5

# ---- The right hand points at the near face of the block on the grid (4.25 m ahead): the trigger places a block there -----------

hand right 0.2 1.3 -0.3 -2.2 -1 0
wait 1
expect no log Build: placed
press right trigger
wait 0.3
release right trigger
wait 1.5
expect log Build: placed LargeBlockArmorBlock within 5
read nearby LargeBlockArmorBlock 8
expect 1.subtype == LargeBlockArmorBlock

# ---- The left trigger removes the block pointed at (creative tools) ---------------------------------------------------------------------

press left trigger
wait 0.3
release left trigger
wait 1.5
expect log Build: removed within 5

# ---- X (the left controller's lower button) switches symmetry; the right stick click switches the block size ---------------------------

press left a
wait 0.2
release left a
wait 1
expect log asked; symmetry now within 5
press right stick
wait 0.2
release right stick
wait 1
expect log Build: block size asked; block LargeBlockArmorBlock -> SmallBlockArmorBlock within 5
# and back: the game keeps the builder's size from world to world, and the tests after this one build large blocks
press right stick
wait 0.2
release right stick
wait 1
expect log Build: block size asked; block SmallBlockArmorBlock -> LargeBlockArmorBlock within 5

# ---- The empty hand (the middle of the tools wheel, the trigger) puts the block away -----------------------------------------------------

press left grip
wait 1
stick left 0 1
wait 0.5
stick left 0 0
wait 1
press right trigger
wait 0.2
release right trigger
release left grip
wait 1.5
expect log Build mode off within 5
expect no log Exception
